Phase 4 output of system-dissector. UNSCORED risk inventory — the raw
material that the C1-C6 rubric in `extract/components.md` and the final
gate in `integrate/risk-score.md` will quantise.

Goal: don't lose context between "this feels risky" (triage impression)
and "this is a T2 / don't port" (scored decision). If a risk isn't in
this file, it can't be quoted in any decision.

Filling conventions:
- One risk per row. Tag category (security | license | ops | data |
