## 7. Multi-tenancy risks

> If the target system is multi-tenant or is being ported into a
> multi-tenant context, capture tenant-isolation risks here. These are
> the ones that can leak data across orgs.

| # | Risk | Where | Severity | Mitigation idea | Evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `<e.g. raw SQL interpolation without org filter>` | `<path>` | high | Add `organization_id` filter to every query | [verified|estimated] |
| 2 | `<e.g. background job processes all orgs together>` | `<path>` | high | Queue per-org, worker per-org | [verified|estimated] |
| 3 | `<e.g. cache key missing org>` | `<path>` | medium | Namespace cache by org_id | [verified|estimated] |

